#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:136
msgid ""
"Each post is scored 0–100 from six rule-based metrics: title, meta "
"description, word count, heading structure, image alt coverage, and internal "
"links. Ten points are always awarded for reading time (informational only). "
"The remaining 90 points are distributed across the other metrics with "
"weights that vary by content profile (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Kila chapisho kinapimwa 0–100 kutoka kwa vigezo sita vinavyotegemea sheria: "
"kichwa, maelezo ya meta, idadi ya maneno, muundo wa vichwa vya habari, "
"ufunuo wa picha, na viungo vya ndani. Pointi kumi daima hapatikana kwa "
"wakati wa kusoma (taarifa tu). Pointi 90 zilizobaki zinagawanywa kwa vigezo "
"vingine kwa uzito unaobadilika kulingana na profaili ya maudhui (angalia "
"chini)."

