#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/LanguageOverridesPanel.php:214
msgid ""
"Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ "
"— a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin "
"reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves "
"them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through "
"all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request."
msgstr ""
"Loco Translate hifadhi tafsiri zake maalum katika wp-content/languages/loco/ "
"— mahali ambapo inaweza kufutwa kwa kimya na sasisho la WP, kufanywa upya "
"kwa programu, au ikiwa Loco Translate yenyewe inatoweka. Nakili faili hapa "
"huziweka kwenye saraka ya Lingua Forge i18n-overrides, ambayo huendelea kuwa "
"hai kupitia matukio yote hayo na hujumuishwa kiotomatiki kila wakati."

