#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CacheStatsPanel.php:106
msgid ""
"The API Response Cache stores the raw result of every AI request — "
"translation, meta description, excerpt, and content generation — keyed by a "
"hash of the inputs (content, language pair, provider, model). Disable during "
"prompt tuning or when you need every request to reach the AI provider. "
"Disabling does not delete cached entries — re-enabling restores them."
msgstr ""
"Kumbukumbu ya Majibu ya API hifadhi matokeo ya awali ya kila ombi la AI — "
"tafsiri, maelezo ya meta, muhtasari, na uundaji wa maudhui — kwa kufuata "
"hash ya maingizo (maudhui, jozi la lugha, mtoa huduma, mfano). Zima wakati "
"wa kurekebisha maombi au unapo hitaji kila ombi lifikie mtoa huduma wa AI. "
"Kuzima hakuhifadhi ingizo zilizohifadhiwa — kuzirudisha tena kunarudisha "
"zile zilizohifadhiwa."

#: ai/assets/admin-diff-modal.js:254
