msgstr "Mu- plugin wa lf-social-share ni hai."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SocialSharePanel.php:62
msgid ""
"The lf-social-share mu-plugin is active. Lingua Forge's built-in Social "
"Share is inactive — the mu-plugin handles share URL rewriting and the JS "
"actions."
msgstr ""
"Mu- plugin wa lf-social-share ni hai. Social Share iliyojengwa ndani ya "
"Lingua Forge haifanyi kazi — mu-plugin inashughulikia uandishi upya wa URL "
"za kushiriki na vitendo vya JS."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:245
msgid ""
"The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above "
"(default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation "
"accuracy as full-page mode for snippets."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha Nuru kinatumia mfano wa haraka uliowekwa kwenye jedwali la "
"Miundo hapo juu (chaguo-msingi: Haiku / Flash). Badilisha kwa Ubora ikiwa "
"unahitaji usahihi wa tafsiri sawa na hali ya ukurasa kamili kwa vipande."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:214
msgid "The phrase as it appears in the source text."
msgstr "Sehemu kama ilivyoonekana katika maandishi ya chanzo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/RouterTab.php:146
msgid ""
"The primary language is always served at the root of your site — no URL "
"prefix in path mode, no language subdomain in subdomain mode. All other "
"languages use either a /lang/ path prefix (e.g. example.com/de/) or a "
"language subdomain (e.g. de.example.com), depending on the URL structure "
"setting below."
msgstr ""
"Lugha kuu daima hutumika kwenye mzizi wa tovuti yako — hakuna kiambishi cha "
"URL katika hali ya njia, hakuna subdomain ya lugha katika hali ya subdomain. "
"Lugha nyingine zote hutumia au kiambishi cha /lang/ (mfano example.com/de/) "
"au subdomain ya lugha (mfano de.example.com), kulingana na mpangilio wa "
"muundo wa URL hapo chini."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:127
msgid ""
"The SEO → Compatibility tab shows the live detection status and explains "
"exactly what LF is doing for each feature area."
msgstr ""
"Kipengele cha SEO → Ulinganifu kinatoa hali ya kugundua moja kwa moja na "
"kinaelezea hasa LF inafanya nini kwa kila eneo la kipengele."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SocialSharePanel.php:162
msgid ""
"The share URL always reflects the current page — no manual URL entry needed. "
"The linguaforge_social_share_url filter lets you override the resolved URL "
"for any service."
msgstr ""
"URL ya kushiriki daima inaonyesha ukurasa wa sasa — hakuna haja ya kuingiza "
"URL kwa mkono. kichungi cha linguaforge_social_share_url hukuruhusu "
"kubadilisha URL iliyotatuliwa kwa huduma yoyote."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsHelp.php:124
msgid ""
"The sitemap is announced in robots.txt automatically. All major search "
"engines — Google, Bing, Yandex — discover it from robots.txt. No manual "
"submission is required."
msgstr ""
"Ramani ya tovuti inatangazwa moja kwa moja katika robots.txt. Mengineyo "
"makuu ya injini za utafutaji — Google, Bing, Yandex — yanagundua kutoka "
"robots.txt. Hakuna uwasilishaji wa mkono unaohitajika."

#: language-router/includes/admin/class-meta-boxes.php:362
#: language-router/includes/admin/class-meta-boxes.php:369
msgid "The source page has no footnotes."
msgstr "Ukurasa wa chanzo haujakuwa na nukuu za mguu wa ukurasa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/LanguageOverridesPanel.php:124
msgid "The upload failed — please try again."
msgstr "Upakuaji umeshindwa — tafadhali jaribu tena."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/SitemapPanel.php:54
msgid ""
"The WordPress core sitemap lists all your content URLs. The LF sitemap tells "
"search engines how language versions relate to each other via xhtml:link "
"hreflang alternates. Submit both to Google Search Console for full coverage."
msgstr ""
"Ramani ya tovuti ya msingi ya WordPress inaorodhesha URL zote za maudhui "
"yako. Ramani ya tovuti ya LF inawaambia injini za utafutaji jinsi toleo za "
"lugha zinavyohusiana kwa njia ya xhtml:link hreflang mbadala. Wasilisha zote "
"kwa Google Search Console kwa ufanisi kamili."

#: language-router/includes/admin/class-meta-boxes.php:374
msgid ""
"These footnotes come from the source page and are shown here for reference "
"only. Add them to this page using the block editor."
msgstr ""
"Nukuu hizi za mguu wa ukurasa zinatoka kwenye ukurasa wa chanzo na "
"zinaonyeshwa hapa kwa marejeo tu. Ziongeze kwenye ukurasa huu kwa kutumia "
"mhariri wa vikundi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:266
msgid ""
"This catalog is updated with each Lingua Forge release. Testing a connection "
"in the API Keys tab also fetches the live model list from the provider and "
"refreshes the suggestions above."
msgstr ""
"Orodha hii huasisiwa na kila toleo la Lingua Forge. Kupima muunganisho "
"kwenye kichupo cha Funguo za API pia kunapata orodha ya modeli hai kutoka "
"kwa mtoa huduma na kuboresha mapendekezo hapo juu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:377
msgid ""
"This is a WooCommerce system page (Shop, Cart, Checkout, etc.). Its content "
"is managed by WooCommerce — the score reflects structural signals only, not "
"user-editable SEO content."
msgstr ""
"Hii ni ukurasa wa mfumo wa WooCommerce (Duka, Mzigo, Malipo, n.k.). Yaliyomo "
"yanashughulikiwa na WooCommerce — alama inaonyesha tu ishara za muundo, si "
"maudhui ya SEO yanayoweza kuhaririwa na mtumiaji."

#: language-router/includes/admin/class-meta-boxes.php:347
msgid ""
"This is the source page. Footnotes are edited directly in the block editor."
msgstr ""
"Hii ni ukurasa wa chanzo. Nukuu za mguu wa ukurasa huhaririwa moja kwa moja "
"kwenye mhariri wa vikundi."

#. translators: %s is the key source: either "environment variable" or "PHP constant".
